# Clean Architecture

## Layers (backend — `apps/api`)
| Layer | Path pattern |
|-------|----------------|
| Presentation | `modules/*/presentation/` |
| Application | `modules/*/application/` |
| Domain | `modules/*/domain/` |
| Infrastructure | `modules/*/infrastructure/`, `shared/` |

## Dependency rule
Dependencies point **inward**. Domain must not import NestJS, Prisma, or HTTP.

## Domain layer must not depend on
- Frameworks, ORMs, external HTTP clients, env/config

## Application layer
Orchestrates use cases; injects repositories and ports via tokens/interfaces.

## Infrastructure layer
Implements repositories and adapters; maps Prisma models to domain.

## Mobile app (`apps/app`)
- **Screens/routes** — UI and navigation only
- **Hooks / context / lib/api** — data fetching and client-side state
- **components/paw** — reusable UI; no direct API business rules
